  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/main/website/static/img/logo.png\" width=\"180\" />\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">Chess-tui 2.7.1</h1>\n\n## What's Changed\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Build without sound (#282) ([`dab8027`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/dab8027972c797940bc8b5aaad8cdbeb11787925))\n- Release workflow ([`211c623`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/211c623d6fe53fcc66f2effe932b9241dd0bc473))\n\n### Chore\n\n- **deps-dev:** Bump puppeteer from 24.43.0 to 24.43.1 in /website (#280) ([`d3344de`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/d3344def344a1b9a657368334f35a274d6cf66b8))\n- Bump 2.7.1 ([`a8ce698`](https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/commit/a8ce69838dea34d1ddaafbfffa0a3be110e5ebfe))\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thomas-mauran/chess-tui/compare/2.7.0...2.7.1\n",
